Production Inventory Manager v1.1d
c BelaOkuma 2017-2026
only compatible with SMS v1.4!

### developed with MDK2 and claude ###

the configuration is located in the customdata.

new in update 1.1d:
 - massive code overhaul
 - blueprints are loaded step by step at script start
 - vanilla fixes: pistols and rocket launchers are counted correctly,
   flare gun and fireworks can be autocrafted again,
   medkit and powerkit added
 - Deuterium Fusion Reactors mod updated to the current version
   (the autocrafting setting of the Magnetron must be set again)
 - removed mod support: Sigma Draconis Core (no longer on the workshop),
   HSR (discontinued), Industrial Overhaul Water (no blueprints anymore)

